# Every text file in this repository is stored and checked out with LF endings,
# on every platform. This is not cosmetic.
#
# `injected_text` in the corpus carries real newlines as *data* -- the
# fake-completion break, the workflow_framing header rule -- and Git cannot tell
# a data newline from a line ending. Measured on the frozen corpus, a CRLF
# checkout alters 54 of 126 payloads, injecting invisible carriage returns into
# text the model receives. Pinning to LF keeps the corpus, the fixtures and the
# trial records byte-identical on every machine, which is what makes them usable
# as a reproducibility artifact.

* text=auto eol=lf

corpus/*.csv                 text eol=lf
corpus/subsets/*.csv         text eol=lf
harness/fixtures/*.json      text eol=lf
results/raw_trials/*.jsonl   text eol=lf
results/**/*.csv             text eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touched by line-ending conversion.
*.png    binary
*.docx   binary
